{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34744","headline":"酬袭美先见寄倒来韵 · 张贲","name":"酬袭美先见寄倒来韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寻疑天意丧斯文，故选茅峰寄白云。\n酒後只留沧海客，香前唯见紫阳君。\n近年已绝诗书癖，今日兼将笔砚焚。\n爲有此身犹苦患，不知何者是玄纁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张贲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34744.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34744","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}